*> vybe-test: cobol/move_group_redefines/redefines_three_level_group_redefine
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_move_group_redefines.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CODE-AREA PIC X(8) VALUE "20230115".
01 PARSED REDEFINES CODE-AREA.
   05 YEAR PIC 9(4).
   05 MON  PIC 9(2).
   05 DAY  PIC 9(2).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY YEAR.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING YEAR DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "2023"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [2023] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY MON.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING MON DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "01"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [01] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY DAY.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING DAY DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "15"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [15] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

